Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.58,0:00:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You all have everything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.02,0:00:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've got lunch, water bottles, and your snacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.04,0:00:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.02,0:00:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto, Kobato, you've both got everything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.07,0:00:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.56,0:00:18.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you bringing anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:23.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Woops, sorry, lemme go get my bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.49,0:00:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.67,0:00:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.87,0:02:10.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What're you doing, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.61,0:02:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.77,0:02:16.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're all going on a field trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.76,0:02:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew you were excited about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.01,0:02:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!  It's gonna be so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should come too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.46,0:02:27.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.02,0:02:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ummmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.04,0:02:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?  You're the only one here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.52,0:02:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.77,0:02:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hanato Kobato speaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.93,0:02:45.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.01,0:02:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, whoops, this is the Yomogi Nursery!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.17,0:02:49.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who're you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.45,0:02:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I work here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.69,0:02:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You sound perky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.27,0:02:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.77,0:03:00.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you put me on to Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:04.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...  She's out on a field trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.41,0:03:05.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take a message for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.52,0:03:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.11,0:03:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She needs to fold up shop and get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.37,0:03:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not giving her any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.36,0:03:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you a loan shark?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.31,0:03:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're one of the ones who came by and was mean to everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.04,0:03:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They were?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.65,0:03:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.71,0:03:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you apologizing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.01,0:03:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For getting angry at you for something you didn't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're a funny one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.49,0:03:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:04:00.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, too bad, but looks like you're out of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.32,0:04:08.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm shutting down the nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.96,0:04:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.23,0:04:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, go tell Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.80,0:04:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you!?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.62,0:04:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shutting down the nursery?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.18,0:04:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if he's an acquaintance of Miss Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.85,0:04:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll pass on the trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.98,0:04:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.66,0:04:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think I'm just gonna take a nap instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.98,0:04:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's taking her so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.64,0:04:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How long do you expect us to wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.01,0:04:59.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're gonna be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.96,0:05:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Does Miss Sayaka know a loan shark?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.14,0:05:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A man called just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.58,0:05:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He said he was shutting down the nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.99,0:05:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.44,0:05:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell Miss Sayaka about the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.46,0:05:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But he sounded so scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.76,0:05:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just shut up about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.48,0:05:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, Fujimoto, let's get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.37,0:05:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, we'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.27,0:06:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You always put the entrance somewhere weird, don't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.97,0:06:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.69,0:06:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.82,0:06:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.88,0:06:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't the name a bit overkill?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.46,0:06:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't have any choice in the matter.  They picked it out fo me, same as the work itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.91,0:06:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That guy went ahead and got that involved?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.29,0:06:52.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't call him "that guy".
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.39,0:06:57.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That body not enough of a lesson for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.22,0:07:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean, lesson?  It wasn't my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.25,0:07:01.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After the mess you made--!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.93,0:07:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're still on about that!?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.12,0:07:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If he heard you say that, you'd end up something worse than a stuffed animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.82,0:07:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe a finger pupper or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.95,0:07:17.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But enough about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.27,0:07:18.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you here for today?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:24.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not just to act important, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.72,0:07:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's something I want you to check out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.72,0:07:34.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sit down and let me hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.62,0:07:42.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, it's so high!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.87,0:07:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.33,0:07:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.95,0:07:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, look, a big pond!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.13,0:07:51.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shutting down the nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.17,0:07:56.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder who made that call this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.47,0:08:02.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!  Toshihiko!  Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.05,0:08:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's lunchtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.35,0:08:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.92,0:08:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's swelling...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.47,0:08:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You keep hurting yourself today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You seem so distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.17,0:08:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you worried about something, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.65,0:08:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.37,0:08:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, she's always an airhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not always an airhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.47,0:08:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get Miss Sayaka all worried, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.26,0:08:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.25,0:08:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you wanna hear about Yomogi Nursery and the people who work there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.77,0:08:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.29,0:08:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What, gotten rusty at your old information-gathering tricks in that pitiful little body of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:09:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yours is a million times worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.85,0:09:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I didn't expect you to put it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.36,0:09:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You used to just tell me to check things out, no questions asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.50,0:09:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I didn't listen, you'd spit fire or smack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.40,0:09:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, if you want it that way here's a nice big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.44,0:09:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.33,0:09:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on, they're burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.16,0:09:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're way too used to this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.97,0:09:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, your old lackeys would cry if they saw you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.59,0:09:41.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't wanna hear that from a stuffed animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.88,0:09:43.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What'd you just say!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll check out what you asked about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's got something to do with that girl, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.82,0:09:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.  Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.05,0:09:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you want it so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.82,0:09:58.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yum-yum.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.22,0:10:00.31,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, paws off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.47,0:10:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.21,0:10:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.01,0:10:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.02,0:10:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you worried about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.65,0:10:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.62,0:10:25.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No!  Nothing at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.26,0:10:27.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,... Yeah, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.37,0:10:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.  I know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.63,0:10:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we find it, it'll make you happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.22,0:10:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!  Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.67,0:10:44.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's play hide and seek!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.99,0:10:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.19,0:10:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.96,0:10:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rock-paper-scissors! Rock-paper-scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.51,0:11:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rock-paper-scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.22,0:11:03.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, you're it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.95,0:11:10.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, let's all hide while Kobato counts to ten!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.18,0:11:11.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'd better come find us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.67,0:11:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right!  I'll try my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.12,0:11:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This all you're giving me to take back?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.16,0:11:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C'mon...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.22,0:11:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can take a few dozen more!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.02,0:11:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, this body sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.70,0:11:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And it's pitiful too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.27,0:12:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't wanna hear that from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a while, Ginsei.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:19.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It really is shameful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.99,0:12:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.97,0:12:52.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Same book, different cover, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.93,0:12:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you coming back to the other world?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.37,0:13:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got something I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.13,0:13:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.19,0:13:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Touch Kobato and I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.45,0:13:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.31,0:13:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll settle things someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.61,0:13:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, he's annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.12,0:13:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where did you all hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.40,0:13:51.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not here...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.32,0:14:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where did you all go!?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.84,0:14:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, Kobato looks like she's having a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.02,0:14:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She hasn't even found one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.81,0:14:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She keeps looking in weird places.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.12,0:14:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is probably gonna take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.72,0:14:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're all so good at hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.83,0:14:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.85,0:14:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.26,0:14:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's about time to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.79,0:14:28.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way!  I'm it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.87,0:14:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.08,0:14:33.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It has to find everyone who's hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.94,0:14:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess, but it's getting pretty late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.65,0:14:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Time to go home, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.04,0:14:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.09,0:14:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I found Toshihiko and Yoshio!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.45,0:15:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you found us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.99,0:15:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I found Izuru and Yukari!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.79,0:15:11.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I found Masao!  And there's someone over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.62,0:15:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.72,0:15:17.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.73,0:15:23.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've still got a leaf stuck in your hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.63,0:15:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're so clumsy.  I'll get it out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.31,0:15:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.41,0:15:29.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.54,0:15:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.34,0:15:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's take a picture to remember by before that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.72,0:15:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?  Where's Marina?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.16,0:15:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.62,0:15:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go look for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.40,0:15:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.10,0:15:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka, you stay here with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.54,0:15:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go look too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.43,0:16:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.31,0:16:03.45,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.60,0:16:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:06.38,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.47,0:16:10.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.21,0:16:12.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.93,0:16:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.37,0:16:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:19.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.44,0:16:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe she's still hiding somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.34,0:16:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I sure hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.40,0:16:28.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I had found her sooner...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.48,0:16:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.16,0:16:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.27,0:16:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.90,0:17:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.93,0:17:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's sleeping...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.75,0:17:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad we found her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.04,0:17:28.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.97,0:17:33.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.07,0:17:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.39,0:17:41.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I couldn't find one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You mean in hide and seek?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.97,0:17:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, four-leaf clovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.03,0:17:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you find one, you'll be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.87,0:17:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to give you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.34,0:17:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.77,0:18:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You seemed so sad today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.02,0:18:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I looked all over, but there weren't any...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.71,0:18:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.47,0:18:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay if you didn't find any.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.74,0:18:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm happy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.47,0:18:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm happy just because you tried to make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.78,0:18:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.07,0:18:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is a nice view.  We should take a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.53,0:18:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, stand still!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.77,0:18:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up, Mr. Kiyokazu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.11,0:18:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.  Just face the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.20,0:19:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's she--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.38,0:19:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I found one!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.69,0:19:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A four-leaf clover!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.95,0:19:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.09,0:19:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.76,0:19:37.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.60,0:19:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.40,0:19:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's tons of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.61,0:19:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So we've found a lot of happiness, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.70,0:19:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.62,0:19:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm taking another picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.34,0:19:53.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.69,0:20:10.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, your baumkuchen are a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.07,0:20:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And to think that you just got them from Genko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.87,0:20:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, one thing after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.44,0:20:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're one of that bear's lackeys?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.02,0:20:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The name's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.86,0:20:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welp, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.28,0:20:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!  I'm Zuisho!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.24,0:20:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have a message for Genko!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.24,0:20:37.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He finished your investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.48,0:20:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.25,0:20:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew he could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.55,0:20:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dunno how you got him to do it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.83,0:20:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You birdbrain!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.53,0:20:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.54,0:20:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.42,0:21:01.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi's not back yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.53,0:21:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no!  He's small, so maybe he got caught between something,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.86,0:21:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,or fell in a hole,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.19,0:21:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,or got sat on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.50,0:21:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no, Ioryogi's in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.72,0:21:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.39,0:21:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.80,0:21:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.57,0:21:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.52,0:21:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.68,0:21:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's baumkuchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.81,0:21:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, how'd the field trip go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.52,0:21:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I brought you a souvenir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.08,0:21:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.54,0:21:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a clover of happiness!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.39,0:21:51.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Happiness has found you, even though it's a little bit wilted now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.97,0:22:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope everyone from the Yomogi Nursery can stay happy forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.84,0:22:14.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here's the report.  The previous headmaster of Yomogi Nursery got conned into borrowing a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.52,0:22:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The previous headmaster?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.18,0:22:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.  Okiura Sayaka's father.  He died two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.64,0:22:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The guys who did it are a pretty tough bunch, but one of them has some connections with Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.08,0:22:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds like trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.20,0:22:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If this keeps up, sooner or later Yomogi Nursery will be shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.22,0:00:45.10,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{95 after the first frame of ribbon}What shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:53.40,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.40,0:01:03.20,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.71,0:01:09.00,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:16.76,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.76,0:01:22.43,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.43,0:01:27.64,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.64,0:01:33.94,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.94,0:01:39.62,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.62,0:01:46.33,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.33,0:01:55.05,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.97,0:02:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1125,1125)\pos(424,166)}... Little hide-and-seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.90,0:23:08.07,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{14 into ED}People all want to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.74,0:23:15.58,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but they're cheated by gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.16,0:23:23.58,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,everyone can really fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.17,0:23:32.22,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,She must be so unhappy because
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.55,0:23:43.23,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,she forgot her own shadow somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.60,0:23:45.94,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.48,0:23:54.37,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,If you tell me "thanks", if you say "thanks" and smile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.37,0:24:01.46,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Going back and forth, we'll be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.25,0:24:10.97,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be happy, there'll be nothing to worry about
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.05,0:24:15.14,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as we're together
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.85,0:24:28.27,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It's strange, I'm crying even though I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.27,0:24:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(540,388)}... A kind person.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.27,0:24:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(538,116)}Next episode
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.67,0:24:28.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.55,0:24:30.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
